Number of Scored Particles: 868

Columns of data are as follows:
 1: Position X [cm]
 2: Position Y [cm]
 3: Position Z [cm]
 4: Direction Cosine X
 5: Direction Cosine Y
 6: Energy [MeV]
 7: Weight
 8: Particle Type (in PDG Format)
 9: Flag to tell if Third Direction Cosine is Negative (1 means true)
10: Flag to tell if this is the First Scored Particle from this History (1 means true)
11: Run ID
12: Event ID
13: Track ID
14: Initial Kinetic Energy [MeV]
15: Vertex Position X [cm]
16: Vertex Position Y [cm]
17: Vertex Position Z [cm]
18: Initial Direction Cosine X
19: Initial Direction Cosine Y
20: Initial Direction Cosine Z

